'''Judas''' is a [[character]] unlocked after beating {{E|Satan}} for the first time. He starts with 1 [[Red Heart container]], 3 {{e|Penny|text=coins}}, and {{i|The Book of Belial}}. Judas also has a 1.35x damage multiplier.

